# NaMiOS — Xorg + startx cho duong boot "console autologin -> startx ->
# startplasma-x11" (ALPHA: de VAO desktop CHAC CHAN tren may KHONG GPU —
# QEMU/TCG, VM, may cu). Ly do bo SDDM: autologin SDDM chap chon duoi QEMU
